  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nMellow Glow is designed to soften your images, making ordinary, everyday scenes feel beautifully cherished. It balances clear blue tones and soft greens with slightly lower contrast that still maintains clarity — suiting almost any scenario. Special care was taken to preserve natural skin tones, making it ideal for portraits or capturing daily moments with the ones you love.\n\nThis preset truly shines during travel, where you might capture a diverse range of subjects — from landscapes and food to flowers and wildlife.\n\nTry using this recipe on those subtle, fleeting scenes you might otherwise overlook.",
